# GitHub Linguist Language Detection Configuration
# Overrides file to exclude Python helper/verification scripts from GitHub language stats

# Treat all Python scripts as vendored/helper utilities so they are excluded from language statistics
*.py linguist-vendored
src/*.py linguist-vendored

# Ensure Cadence Spectre netlist files (.scs) are recognized as SPICE language
*.scs linguist-language=SPICE

# Mark documentation files explicitly
docs/* linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
